{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DodgeAndRun is a simple, high-difficulty run-and-jump game set in a Japanese-style world. Use three different speeds strategically to keep moving forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>A beautiful Japanese-style world</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/5de6bb8669bbb4ba4468f97d65d88baa.poster.avif?t=1766730241\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/5de6bb8669bbb4ba4468f97d65d88baa.webm?t=1766730241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/5de6bb8669bbb4ba4468f97d65d88baa.mp4?t=1766730241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>You become a nameless ninja, relentlessly advancing through this world. What awaits you at the end of this journey?</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>For now, nothing is known.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Use the coins you've earned to gain an advantage in gameplay.</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/1b47cce95e85678040c2a790fe1794f7.poster.avif?t=1766730241\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/1b47cce95e85678040c2a790fe1794f7.webm?t=1766730241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/1b47cce95e85678040c2a790fe1794f7.mp4?t=1766730241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>After clearing a stage, you can use coins collected along the way to purchase abilities and extra lives.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Destroy everything with the invincibility gauge</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/4dbc617860d7ccf18077142b28d7c467.poster.avif?t=1766730241\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/4dbc617860d7ccf18077142b28d7c467.webm?t=1766730241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/4dbc617860d7ccf18077142b28d7c467.mp4?t=1766730241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>A special move that charges just by running! When players become invincible, they can advance forward while destroying all obstacles. Choose your timing wisely!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Evolving field</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/a03d3f7f436cce8071ab3201aab88754.poster.avif?t=1766730241\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/a03d3f7f436cce8071ab3201aab88754.webm?t=1766730241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/a03d3f7f436cce8071ab3201aab88754.mp4?t=1766730241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Objects destroyed using invincibility transform into coins. Even if you get defeated, you'll have an advantage in the next run!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through stages by jumping and moving to avoid various obstacles (spikes, logs, blocks, etc.).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are defeated when you have zero lives remaining, it will be game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing a stage, you proceed to the next stage via the result screen and ability shop. Clearing the final stage completes the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816710?t=1766730241","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/bbdd610f682ac14ad5488bf668aa84f2345d8a3f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766730241","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/6ab333c55899d2477ce3f804d9b1d48029407280/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766730241","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/6ab333c55899d2477ce3f804d9b1d48029407280/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766730241","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DodgeAndRun is a simple, high-difficulty run-and-jump game set in a Japanese-style world. Use three different speeds strategically to keep moving forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>A beautiful Japanese-style world</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras